sequenceDiagram
    participant Client as External Client
    participant MM as ModelMesh Container<br/>TLS/Auth Boundary
    participant Caikit as caikit-tgis-backend<br/>(Caikit Module)
    participant LBProxy as GRPCLoadBalancerProxy<br/>(Client-side LB)
    participant DNS as DNS Service
    participant TGIS as TGIS Instance<br/>(Text Gen Inference)

    Note over Client,TGIS: Inference Request Flow (Generate / GenerateStream)

    Client->>MM: gRPC fmaas.GenerationService/Generate<br/>TLS + Auth (platform-managed)
    MM->>Caikit: Pod-local gRPC<br/>(co-located containers)

    Note over LBProxy,DNS: DNS polling (every 10s) for TGIS endpoints

    LBProxy-->>DNS: DNS lookup (poll interval: 10s)
    DNS-->>LBProxy: TGIS endpoint IPs

    Caikit->>LBProxy: Delegate inference call
    LBProxy->>TGIS: gRPC inference request<br/>(round_robin, configurable TLS)
    TGIS-->>LBProxy: Inference result
    LBProxy-->>Caikit: Inference result
    Caikit-->>MM: gRPC response
    MM-->>Client: gRPC response<br/>TLS

    Note over Client,TGIS: Streaming Generation Flow (GenerateStream)

    Client->>MM: gRPC fmaas.GenerationService/GenerateStream<br/>TLS + Auth
    MM->>Caikit: Pod-local gRPC stream
    Caikit->>LBProxy: Delegate stream call
    LBProxy->>TGIS: gRPC streaming request
    loop Token Generation
        TGIS-->>LBProxy: Stream token
        LBProxy-->>Caikit: Stream token
        Caikit-->>MM: Stream token
        MM-->>Client: Stream token
    end

    Note over Client,TGIS: Health Check Flow

    Caikit->>TGIS: HTTP health check<br/>(requests library)
    TGIS-->>Caikit: Health status

    Note over Client,TGIS: DNS Endpoint Discovery & Reconnection

    LBProxy-->>DNS: Periodic DNS poll (10s interval)
    DNS-->>LBProxy: Updated endpoint list
    Note over LBProxy: Detect new endpoints →<br/>Reconnect gRPC channel<br/>(transparent to callers)
